<p>Lay a magical trap that summons a trio of shadowy rogues to attack the target.</p><p>The rogues receive your damage bonuses and are permanently stealthed.</p><p>They disappear after <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns or when their work is done.</p>